{
  "john.13.p1.b1": {
    "text": "逾越节以前，耶稣知道自己离世归父的时候到了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "逾⁠越⁠节以⁠前，耶⁠稣知⁠道自⁠己离世归父的时⁠候到⁠了。"
  },
  "john.13.p1.b2": {
    "text": "他既然爱世间属自己的人，就爱他们到底。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他既⁠然爱世⁠间属自⁠己的人，就⁠爱他⁠们到⁠底。"
  },
  "john.13.p1.b3": {
    "text": "吃晚饭的时候，魔鬼已将卖耶稣的意思放在……犹大心里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "吃晚⁠饭的时⁠候，魔⁠鬼已将卖耶⁠稣的意⁠思放⁠在……犹⁠大心⁠里。"
  },
  "john.13.p1.b4": {
    "text": "就离席站起来，脱了衣服，拿一条手巾束腰，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就离⁠席站⁠起⁠来，脱⁠了衣⁠服，拿一⁠条手⁠巾束⁠腰，"
  },
  "john.13.p2.b1": {
    "text": "随后把水倒在盆里，就洗门徒的脚，并用自己所束的手巾擦干。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "随⁠后把水倒⁠在盆里，就洗门⁠徒的脚，并用自⁠己所束的手⁠巾擦⁠干。"
  },
  "john.13.p2.b2": {
    "text": "主啊，你洗我的脚吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，你洗我⁠的脚吗？"
  },
  "john.13.p2.b3": {
    "text": "我所做的，你如今不知道，后来必明白。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我所做⁠的，你如⁠今不⁠知⁠道，后⁠来必明⁠白。"
  },
  "john.13.p3.b1": {
    "text": "你永不可洗我的脚！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你永不⁠可洗我⁠的脚！"
  },
  "john.13.p3.b2": {
    "text": "我若不洗你，你就与我无分了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.13.p3.b3": {
    "text": "主啊，不但我的脚，连手和头也要洗。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，不⁠但我⁠的脚，连手和头也⁠要洗。"
  },
  "john.13.p4.b1": {
    "text": "凡洗过澡的人，只要把脚一洗，全身就干净了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "凡洗⁠过澡的人，只⁠要把脚一洗，全⁠身就干⁠净了。"
  },
  "john.13.p4.b2": {
    "text": "你们是干净的，然而不都是干净的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们是干⁠净的，然⁠而不都⁠是干⁠净的。"
  },
  "john.13.p4.b3": {
    "text": "耶稣原知道要卖他的是谁，所以说：「你们不都是干净的。」",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣原知⁠道要卖他⁠的是谁，所⁠以说：「你⁠们不都⁠是干⁠净的。」"
  },
  "john.13.p5.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣洗完了他们的脚，就穿上衣服，又坐下，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣洗⁠完了他⁠们的脚，就穿⁠上衣⁠服，又坐⁠下，"
  },
  "john.13.p5.b2": {
    "text": "我向你们所做的，你们明白吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我向你⁠们所做⁠的，你⁠们明⁠白吗？"
  },
  "john.13.p5.b3": {
    "text": "我是你们的主，你们的夫子，尚且洗你们的脚，你们也当彼此洗脚。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠是你⁠们的主，你⁠们的夫⁠子，尚⁠且洗你⁠们的脚，你⁠们也当彼⁠此洗脚。"
  },
  "john.13.p6.b1": {
    "text": "仆人不能大于主人，差人也不能大于差他的人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "仆⁠人不⁠能大⁠于主⁠人，差人也⁠不⁠能大⁠于差他⁠的人。"
  },
  "john.13.p6.b2": {
    "text": "你们既知道这事，若是去行就有福了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们既知⁠道这事，若⁠是去行就⁠有福了。"
  },
  "john.13.p6.b3": {
    "text": "我知道我所拣选的是谁。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠知⁠道我所拣⁠选的⁠是谁。"
  },
  "john.13.p6.b4": {
    "text": "现在要应验经上的话，说：『同我吃饭的人用脚踢我。』",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "现⁠在要应验经上的⁠话，说：『同我吃⁠饭的人用脚踢我。』"
  },
  "john.13.p7.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣说了这话，心里忧愁，就明说：",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣说了这话，心⁠里忧⁠愁，就明说："
  },
  "john.13.p7.b2": {
    "text": "我实实在在地告诉你们，你们中间有一个人要卖我了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我实实⁠在在地告⁠诉你⁠们，你⁠们中⁠间有⁠一个⁠人要卖我了。"
  },
  "john.13.p7.b3": {
    "text": "门徒彼此对看，猜不透所说的是谁。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "门⁠徒彼⁠此对看，猜⁠不⁠透所说的⁠是谁。"
  },
  "john.13.p8.b1": {
    "text": "有一个门徒，是耶稣所爱的，侧身挨近耶稣的怀里。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有一⁠个门⁠徒，是耶⁠稣所爱⁠的，侧身挨⁠近耶⁠稣的怀里。"
  },
  "john.13.p8.b2": {
    "text": "你告诉我们，主是指着谁说的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你告⁠诉我⁠们，主是指着谁说⁠的。"
  },
  "john.13.p8.b3": {
    "text": "主啊，是谁呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.13.p9.b1": {
    "text": "我蘸一点饼给谁，就是谁。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我蘸一⁠点饼给谁，就⁠是谁。"
  },
  "john.13.p9.b2": {
    "text": "耶稣就蘸了一点饼，递给加略人西门的儿子犹大。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣就蘸了一⁠点饼，递给加⁠略人西⁠门的儿⁠子犹⁠大。"
  },
  "john.13.p9.b3": {
    "text": "他吃了以后，撒但就入了他的心。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他吃⁠了以⁠后，撒⁠但就入了他⁠的心。"
  },
  "john.13.p9.b4": {
    "text": "你所做的，快做吧！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你所做⁠的，快做吧！"
  },
  "john.13.p10.b1": {
    "text": "同席的人没有一个知道是为什么对他说这话。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "同⁠席的人没⁠有一⁠个知⁠道是为⁠什⁠么对他说这话。"
  },
  "john.13.p10.b2": {
    "text": "有人……以为耶稣是对他说：「你去买我们过节所应用的东西」，或是叫他拿什么周济穷人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠人……以⁠为耶⁠稣是对他说：「你去买我⁠们过⁠节所应⁠用的东⁠西」，或⁠是叫他拿什⁠么周⁠济穷⁠人。"
  },
  "john.13.p10.b3": {
    "text": "犹大受了那点饼，立刻就出去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "犹⁠大受了那点饼，立⁠刻就出⁠去。"
  },
  "john.13.p10.b4": {
    "text": "那时候是夜间了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那时⁠候是夜⁠间了。"
  },
  "john.13.p11.b1": {
    "text": "如今人子得了荣耀，　神在人子身上也得了荣耀。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "如⁠今人⁠子得⁠了荣⁠耀，　神在人⁠子身⁠上也得⁠了荣⁠耀。"
  },
  "john.13.p11.b2": {
    "text": "小子们，我还有不多的时候与你们同在；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "小⁠子们，我还⁠有不⁠多的时⁠候与你⁠们同在；"
  },
  "john.13.p11.b3": {
    "text": "后来你们要找我，但我所去的地方你们不能到。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "后⁠来你⁠们要找我，但我所去的地⁠方你⁠们不⁠能到。"
  },
  "john.13.p12.b1": {
    "text": "我赐给你们一条新命令，乃是叫你们彼此相爱；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我赐⁠给你⁠们一⁠条新命⁠令，乃⁠是叫你⁠们彼⁠此相⁠爱；"
  },
  "john.13.p12.b2": {
    "text": "我怎样爱你们，你们也要怎样相爱。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我怎⁠样爱你⁠们，你⁠们也⁠要怎⁠样相⁠爱。"
  },
  "john.13.p12.b3": {
    "text": "你们若有彼此相爱的心，众人因此就认出你们是我的门徒了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们若⁠有彼⁠此相⁠爱的心，众⁠人因⁠此就认⁠出你⁠们是我⁠的门⁠徒了。"
  },
  "john.13.p13.b1": {
    "text": "主往哪里去？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主往哪⁠里去？"
  },
  "john.13.p13.b2": {
    "text": "我所去的地方，你现在不能跟我去，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我所去的地⁠方，你现⁠在不⁠能跟我⁠去，"
  },
  "john.13.p13.b3": {
    "text": "后来却要跟我去。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "后⁠来却⁠要跟我⁠去。"
  },
  "john.13.p14.b1": {
    "text": "主啊，我为什么现在不能跟你去？我愿意为你舍命！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，我为⁠什⁠么现⁠在不⁠能跟你去？我⁠愿⁠意为你舍⁠命！"
  },
  "john.13.p14.b2": {
    "text": "你愿意为我舍命吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你愿⁠意为⁠我舍⁠命吗？"
  },
  "john.13.p14.b3": {
    "text": "我实实在在地告诉你，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我实实⁠在在地告⁠诉你，"
  },
  "john.13.p14.b4": {
    "text": "鸡叫以先，你要三次不认我。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 13:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "鸡叫以先，你⁠要三⁠次不认我。"
  }
}
